<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
    <TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
    <Nullable>disable</Nullable>
    <ImplicitUsings>disable</ImplicitUsings>
    <AssemblyName>shop-price-probe</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>ShopPriceProbe</RootNamespace>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!--
    M3⑤-实现 3（卡 openmir2-m3-shop-price-formula）真身向量生成器：
    引用 oracle **真身**（src/GameSrv/GameSrv.csproj），用反射直调 `GameSrv.Npc.Merchant` 的私有方法：
      - GetItemPrice(ushort)         Merchant.cs:347
      - GetUserItemPrice(UserItem)   Merchant.cs:1130
      - GetUserPrice(IPlayerActor, double) Merchant.cs:765
      - GetSellItemPrice(double)     Merchant.cs:1358（private static）
      - ClientQueryRepairCost(IPlayerActor, UserItem) Merchant.cs:1555
      - ClientRepairItem(IPlayerActor, UserItem)      Merchant.cs:1599
    产物 = mir2-rs/tests/parity/m3/shop-price-probe/vectors/shop_price_vectors.{json,tsv}
    Rust 侧用例 `crates/formula/tests/shop_price_vectors.rs` 据 TSV 逐字段核对。

    只读：不连 MySQL、不写任何现网文件、不发起任何 socket、不起栈、不占端口。
    `IPlayerActor`/`IUserCastle` 用 DispatchProxy 动态替身，`SystemShare.ItemSystem` 换成内存表。
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\..\..\src\GameSrv\GameSrv.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
